{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"羅馬書","commonName":"羅馬書","title":"羅馬書","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"f560c474555cc22353f7bb93dfa2f9103b88816017ae271ebc73851cc8c479f1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["基督裏的新生活"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所以，弟兄們，我以上帝的慈悲勸你們，將身體獻上，當作活祭，是聖潔的，是上帝所喜悅的；你們如此事奉乃是理所當然的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["不要效法這個世界，只要心意更新而變化，叫你們察驗何為上帝的善良、純全、可喜悅的旨意。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我憑着所賜我的恩對你們各人說：不要看自己過於所當看的；要照着上帝所分給各人信心的大小，看得合乎中道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["正如我們一個身子上有好些肢體，肢體也不都是一樣的用處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我們這許多人，在基督裏成為一身，互相聯絡作肢體，也是如此。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["按我們所得的恩賜，各有不同。或說預言，就當照着信心的程度說預言；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["或作執事，就當專一執事；或作教導的，就當專一教導；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["或作勸化的，就當專一勸化；施捨的，就當誠實；治理的，就當殷勤；憐憫人的，就當甘心。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["基督徒的生活守則"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["愛人不可虛假。惡，要厭惡；善，要親近。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["愛弟兄，要彼此親熱；恭敬人，要彼此推讓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["殷勤，不可懶惰；要心裏火熱，常常服事主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["在指望中要喜樂；在患難中要忍耐；禱告要恆切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["聖徒缺乏，要幫補；客，要一味地款待。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["逼迫你們的，要給他們祝福；只要祝福，不可咒詛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["與喜樂的人要同樂；與哀哭的人要同哭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["要彼此同心；不要志氣高大，倒要俯就卑微的人",{"noteId":13},"。不要自以為聰明。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["不要以惡報惡；眾人以為美的事要留心去做。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["若是能行，總要盡力與眾人和睦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["親愛的弟兄，不要自己伸冤，寧可讓步，聽憑主怒",{"noteId":14},"；因為經上記着：「主說：『伸冤在我，我必報應。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["所以，「你的仇敵若餓了，就給他吃，若渴了，就給他喝；因為你這樣行就是把炭火堆在他的頭上。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["你不可為惡所勝，反要以善勝惡。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":13,"caller":"-","text":"人：或譯事","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":16}},{"noteId":14,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：讓人發怒","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}